WEBVTT

00:32.450 --> 00:34.950
<b><i>The Brothers from Heaven.</i></b>

00:43.750 --> 00:47.040
<b>Another gracious message
has descended from the heavens today.</b>

00:47.130 --> 00:49.340
<b>Do we really gotta
listen to you right now?</b>

00:49.420 --> 00:53.050
<b>I only had enough in me to starfish
all last night. I'm fucking wrecked.</b>

00:53.130 --> 00:54.800
<b>You lazy-ass bitches!</b>

00:54.880 --> 00:57.970
<b>You'll never get back into Heaven
with that attitude.</b>

00:58.050 --> 01:00.260
<b>So what?
It's not like we're bothering anyone.</b>

01:00.350 --> 01:01.810
<b>Speak for yourselves!</b>

01:01.890 --> 01:03.140
<b>As live-in freeloaders,</b>

01:03.230 --> 01:07.060
<b>all the cleaning, laundry, and cooking
would be divvied up as per the rules,</b>

01:07.150 --> 01:09.360
<b>so why does it always fall to us?</b>

01:09.440 --> 01:11.320
<b>I couldn't agree more, Dearest Sister.</b>

01:11.400 --> 01:14.780
<b>Hey, I do my part.
My laundry goes in the floor pile.</b>

01:14.860 --> 01:17.820
<b>And would it kill ya to serve pancakes
and chocolate shakes for breakfast?</b>

01:17.910 --> 01:19.330
<b>-As you wish－
-As you wish－</b>

01:20.950 --> 01:25.460
<b>-We are not handmaids or groupies!
-You demons oughta be knocked down a peg.</b>

01:25.540 --> 01:28.250
<b>Enough bitchin'!
Heaven has spoken!</b>

01:28.330 --> 01:30.420
<b>Go! Panty and Stocking!</b>

01:30.500 --> 01:33.170
<b>And Scanty and Kneesocks!</b>

01:37.510 --> 01:39.350
<b>-Hey, Brief, my boy.
-Yo.</b>

01:39.430 --> 01:41.510
<b>We're having a screening of
Dances with Wolves</b>

01:41.600 --> 01:43.270
<b>at the Geek Club this weekend, buddy.</b>

01:43.350 --> 01:46.230
<b>It'd be real decent if you could
round up some of your pals, eh?</b>

01:46.310 --> 01:48.730
<b>Nice! The director's cut
is over four hours long, and－</b>

01:49.310 --> 01:53.780
<b>Wow! The action in <i>Perfect Waterworld</i>
was, like, totally the bomb!</b>

01:54.990 --> 01:56.990
<b>All righty then, Brief…
catch ya later, buddy!</b>

01:57.070 --> 01:58.530
<b>Hey, who's the Geek Girl?</b>

01:58.610 --> 02:01.490
<b>Oh, she's just a friend from a club.
Her name's－</b>

02:02.700 --> 02:06.750
<b>Oh my! Taking a little detour, are we?
How leisurely of our vacant-faced angel.</b>

02:06.830 --> 02:07.830
<b>You got somethin' to say?</b>

02:07.920 --> 02:10.500
<b>How about this? The rules are simple.</b>

02:10.580 --> 02:13.750
<b>From now on,
whoever earns the most coins, wins.</b>

02:13.840 --> 02:16.220
<b>The losers become slaves to the winners.</b>

02:16.300 --> 02:17.420
<b>Sounds perfect. I'm in.</b>

02:17.510 --> 02:18.840
<b>You're gonna eat those words,</b>

02:18.930 --> 02:20.590
<b>you scum-sucking hellrats!</b>

02:32.610 --> 02:34.900
<b>They just keep on comin', don't they?</b>

02:34.980 --> 02:37.440
<b>I wanna change up my nails.
What do you think I should get next?</b>

02:38.740 --> 02:40.450
<b>Please, have mercy!</b>

02:40.530 --> 02:43.240
<b>I'm a Cicada Ghost,
seven years in the making.</b>

02:43.330 --> 02:46.540
<b>I lived and died underground waiting
in vain for a mate that never came!</b>

02:46.620 --> 02:47.830
<b>Seven years? Seriously?</b>

02:47.910 --> 02:50.330
<b>No sex, no life. Can't say no to that.</b>

02:50.420 --> 02:52.630
<b>Go on. Go get some. Scram.</b>

02:52.710 --> 02:55.380
<b>You've burrowed your way into my heart－</b>

02:59.630 --> 03:00.800
<b>My eyes! The bangs do nothing!</b>

03:01.640 --> 03:03.760
<b>Mercy hath no place in Heaven.</b>

03:03.850 --> 03:07.770
<b>You let a Ghost go scot-free?
That's, like, a no from me.</b>

03:07.850 --> 03:09.350
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

03:09.440 --> 03:11.730
<b>My name is Angel Polyester.</b>

03:13.360 --> 03:15.520
<b>Their skin's so bright
they're overexposed!</b>

03:15.610 --> 03:17.990
<b>And my name is Angel Polyurethane.</b>

03:19.570 --> 03:23.820
<b>As of today, we're officially in charge
of this whole Daten City scene.</b>

03:23.910 --> 03:27.370
<b>Like, we're lowkey new angels,
Newgen Angels.</b>

03:28.580 --> 03:29.960
<b>Why am I being forced to the floor?</b>

03:30.040 --> 03:31.870
<b>They're making us bend the knee!</b>

03:34.040 --> 03:35.130
<b>The fuck is that?</b>

03:35.210 --> 03:37.170
<b>I guess you could call it
a written judgment.</b>

03:37.250 --> 03:40.170
<b>Something about gross misuse
of Heavenly Freedom?</b>

03:40.260 --> 03:43.680
<b>Angel Pantiel and Angel Stockiel
are hereby charged</b>

03:43.760 --> 03:46.010
<b>guilty of misappropriating their freedoms.</b>

03:46.100 --> 03:49.310
<b>Their Heaven Licenses,
permitting operations on Earth,</b>

03:49.390 --> 03:51.390
<b>are hereby revoked.</b>

03:51.480 --> 03:54.770
<b>So, like, we'll be taking
those licenses, please!</b>

03:54.860 --> 03:56.190
<b>Licenses?</b>

03:56.270 --> 03:57.940
<b>The hell is that?</b>

03:58.030 --> 03:59.820
<b>-You mean these?
-Garter!</b>

04:00.440 --> 04:02.910
<b>Didn't want it gettin' lost, so I
stashed it somewhere sacred…</b>

04:02.990 --> 04:04.950
<b>right next to the butter
in the damn fridge.</b>

04:05.030 --> 04:08.990
<b>But these ain't something you give to
any old fool that walks in off the street.</b>

04:09.080 --> 04:10.200
<b>Preach it to the choir!</b>

04:10.290 --> 04:13.210
<b>Polyester and Polyurethane… Wait!</b>

04:13.920 --> 04:17.250
<b>Aren't these our cousins?
Daddy's little brother's twerps.</b>

04:17.340 --> 04:19.420
<b>Dad's little brother…
You mean Uncle Ramie?</b>

04:19.510 --> 04:23.180
<b>Don't tell me these plastic fantastics
used to be those snot-faced little whelps?</b>

04:23.260 --> 04:27.680
<b>Whoa, didn't expect you two
to be that sharp. Props, honestly.</b>

04:27.760 --> 04:29.180
<b>Ramie?</b>

04:29.260 --> 04:32.520
<b>Hold the phone! Not Ramie
the Supreme Overseer of Heavenly Ethics?</b>

04:32.600 --> 04:36.650
<b>So that would put these two way up
in the ranks of the big shots in Heaven!</b>

04:36.730 --> 04:38.650
<b>Begging your forgiveness.
These are all yours.</b>

04:38.730 --> 04:41.570
<b>Please take Panty and Stocking's
Heaven Licenses!</b>

04:41.650 --> 04:42.900
<b>-Hey!
-You're a gem.</b>

04:42.990 --> 04:44.740
<b>Thanks a bunch, Father man!</b>

04:45.490 --> 04:48.080
<b>-Whoa!
-What the hell was that for?</b>

04:48.160 --> 04:51.250
<b>Now your licenses are,
like, totally invalid.</b>

04:51.330 --> 04:53.750
<b>I'll say it again
for the people in the back.</b>

04:53.830 --> 04:57.460
<b>Basically, you guys just lost your right
to exorcize Ghosts on Earth.</b>

04:57.540 --> 04:58.540
<b>How dare you!</b>

04:58.630 --> 05:00.420
<b>What are you even aiming at?</b>

05:00.500 --> 05:02.800
<b>You dumbasses.
You're just wasting your bullets.</b>

05:08.300 --> 05:09.510
<b>What the…</b>

05:09.600 --> 05:11.890
<b>Don't tell me they know
the exact moment a Ghost'll show?</b>

05:13.890 --> 05:19.610
<b>It's the Ghost Vision Pro Max. It, like,
knows when a Ghost is gonna spawn.</b>

05:20.730 --> 05:21.860
<b>See? Over there.</b>

05:25.990 --> 05:30.780
<b>Splendid! To think we ever doubted
the cunning of Ramie's supreme protégé.</b>

05:30.870 --> 05:34.290
<b>Something something Ghost Sex?
I want one too!</b>

05:35.000 --> 05:39.590
<b>While you two were literally clowning 24/7
and skipping out on your Ghost hunting,</b>

05:39.670 --> 05:41.590
<b>the world's entered a new era.</b>

05:41.670 --> 05:43.670
<b>You should prolly just call it quits</b>

05:43.760 --> 05:47.680
<b>and spend the rest of your lives
in this boring dump of a town.</b>

05:47.760 --> 05:52.100
<b>Fuck. Now you're just being cocky.</b>

05:56.730 --> 05:57.980
<b>What the hell?!</b>

05:58.060 --> 05:59.690
<b>Shit. It won't go back to normal.</b>

05:59.770 --> 06:01.980
<b>Your weapons have now
been locked.</b>

06:02.070 --> 06:05.820
<b>So those weapons that are giving boomer
aesthetics are even more useless now.</b>

06:06.780 --> 06:07.860
<b>Look! A huge truck!</b>

06:07.950 --> 06:12.200
<b>Double Low-Riser!
She's, like, our beloved truck.</b>

06:12.280 --> 06:14.160
<b>A wonderful name.
Oh, sons of the great Ramie!</b>

06:14.240 --> 06:16.960
<b>That has some, like, serious
"welcome to the new age" vibes.</b>

06:18.210 --> 06:21.380
<b>Such pitiable clowns
parading their failures so earnestly?</b>

06:21.460 --> 06:23.000
<b>That is just pure comedy gold!</b>

06:23.090 --> 06:24.960
<b>You're absolutely right, Sister.</b>

06:25.050 --> 06:26.880
<b>-Huh?
-But those angel wannabes over there?</b>

06:26.970 --> 06:28.590
<b>-How utterly unsavory.
-Um…</b>

06:28.680 --> 06:30.340
<b>Just as dear Kneesocks mentioned,
I couldn't agree more.</b>

06:30.430 --> 06:34.060
<b>Nothing but little miscreants
drunk on their own self-importance.</b>

06:34.140 --> 06:36.350
<b>Even in Hell,
that breed belongs in a landfill.</b>

06:36.430 --> 06:39.060
<b>What? Why are there demons here?</b>

06:39.140 --> 06:40.400
<b>Avert your gaze, foul spawn.</b>

06:41.610 --> 06:43.980
<b>You could at least try
to look like real demons.</b>

06:55.290 --> 06:57.450
<b>Oh, my God. I'm, like, dead!
This is gonna go viral.</b>

07:01.920 --> 07:03.460
<b>Wow, that was rough.</b>

07:05.130 --> 07:06.170
<b>Are you seeing this?</b>

07:06.960 --> 07:08.220
<b>Oh, I'm picking up a Ghost.</b>

07:08.300 --> 07:09.760
<b>Ghost detected.</b>

07:10.720 --> 07:12.680
<b>I applaud you, sons of Ramie!</b>

07:12.760 --> 07:14.220
<b>What the hell is going on here?</b>

07:14.850 --> 07:17.560
<b>You motherfuckers… Just you wait…</b>

07:18.100 --> 07:20.480
<b>Oops! Shift's over.</b>

07:21.100 --> 07:23.980
<b>Okay, we're off.
Like, who does overtime these days?</b>

07:24.060 --> 07:28.990
<b>We're outtie, on the dot.
Gotta have that work-life balance, y'know?</b>

07:29.070 --> 07:30.650
<b>Later, alligator!</b>

07:30.740 --> 07:33.780
<b>Marvelous. Simply marvelous.
Here, why don't I join－</b>

07:35.660 --> 07:37.450
<b>Fuck! Fuck! Fuck!</b>

07:37.540 --> 07:41.370
<b>Lemme at 'em! I'll break the ever-living
fuck out of those designer freaks!</b>

07:41.460 --> 07:45.500
<b>Dumbass nepo babies.
And this is why I hate working with kids.</b>

07:45.590 --> 07:48.840
<b>And you! What makes you think you can
give our shit to someone else, huh?</b>

07:48.920 --> 07:51.760
<b>Keep it up and I'll gladly stuff you in
the butter compartment for life!</b>

07:52.800 --> 07:54.890
<b>Well, we gotta do
something about this first.</b>

07:54.970 --> 07:58.180
<b>Listen up, Geek Boy!
Find us a Lingerie Gunrunner, stat!</b>

07:58.270 --> 08:02.190
<b>Lemme see…
Lingerie, space, Gunrunner, near me…</b>

08:02.270 --> 08:04.100
<b>I don't think it's gonna be this easy.</b>

08:04.190 --> 08:05.980
<b>Huh? An obnoxious and blatantly shifty ad?</b>

08:06.650 --> 08:08.730
<b>I know I shouldn't click it, but…</b>

08:08.820 --> 08:10.780
<b>Uh-oh, why do they
always make the X so small?</b>

08:10.860 --> 08:12.570
<b>Oh, crap! I clicked it!</b>

08:12.650 --> 08:13.780
<b>-Huh?
-What's this?</b>

08:14.360 --> 08:17.660
<b><i>Looking for the best
Lingerie Gunrunner around?</i></b>

08:17.740 --> 08:19.580
<b><i>Look no further than Gunsmith Bitch.</i></b>

08:19.660 --> 08:21.750
<b><i>Pants Dimension.</i></b>

08:25.830 --> 08:26.840
<b>Here it is!</b>

08:28.170 --> 08:29.800
<b>The Lingerie Gunrunner's crib, huh?</b>

08:29.880 --> 08:33.090
<b>I know a deviant type when I smell it.
We'd better be on the lookout.</b>

08:33.180 --> 08:36.090
<b>You there! Open up!
We know you're in there.</b>

08:36.180 --> 08:38.470
<b>-It's you.
-Brief, my boy!</b>

08:38.560 --> 08:41.850
<b>It's that Geek Girl from before.
What are you doing here?</b>

08:41.930 --> 08:44.650
<b>Well… 'cause this
is my frickin' house, buddy.</b>

08:44.730 --> 08:49.230
<b>Wait, this ain't the crib
of that badass Gunsmith Bitch?</b>

08:49.320 --> 08:53.150
<b>Oh, you're customers? Word.
Well, right this way then.</b>

08:54.240 --> 08:57.240
<b>Well? Where's the Gunsmith Bitch?</b>

08:57.320 --> 08:59.620
<b>Where, ya ask? Right here, buddy!</b>

09:05.170 --> 09:06.960
<b>I'm Gunsmith Bitch!</b>

09:08.460 --> 09:10.050
<b>Oh, I'm not pretending.</b>

09:10.130 --> 09:12.050
<b>Oh, no, that's not cosplay.</b>

09:12.130 --> 09:13.550
<b>I'm two sides of a single coin.</b>

09:13.630 --> 09:17.010
<b>Buddy, tryin' to live
as just one kinda gal…</b>

09:17.090 --> 09:18.220
<b>is pretty rough, you know!</b>

09:18.300 --> 09:19.390
<b>But if you make it…</b>

09:19.470 --> 09:20.510
<b>your own…</b>

09:20.600 --> 09:21.600
<b>isn't that just so…</b>

09:21.680 --> 09:22.930
<b>fetch?</b>

09:23.020 --> 09:26.100
<b>The visuals are so erratic,
and I have no idea what she's saying.</b>

09:26.190 --> 09:28.650
<b>Fetch never happened!
Just shut up and help us already!</b>

09:28.730 --> 09:30.190
<b>Okay!</b>

09:30.270 --> 09:33.610
<b>Well then, let me say it again.
Welcome to my crib!</b>

09:37.990 --> 09:39.200
<b>Whoa…</b>

09:39.910 --> 09:41.540
<b>What is this place?</b>

09:42.620 --> 09:44.540
<b>This is the Pants Dimension.</b>

09:44.620 --> 09:46.330
<b>Pants… Dimension?</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:52.960
<b>Yessiree! We take your regular old panties
and phase hop them into good ol' weapons.</b>

09:53.050 --> 09:55.090
<b>This is where we dream it,
serve it, and sell it!</b>

09:56.340 --> 10:01.430
<b>Those fucking iPad kids with the drip
locked our heavenly weapons.</b>

10:01.510 --> 10:02.560
<b>Can you remove 'em?</b>

10:02.640 --> 10:04.930
<b>I got you, fam.
That'll be easy-peasy Japanesey.</b>

10:05.020 --> 10:08.230
<b>Can you remove the limiter and add
a bunch of cool extras while you're at it?</b>

10:08.310 --> 10:10.230
<b>I want this! And this. And this as well!</b>

10:10.310 --> 10:12.690
<b>-Relax. You got the cash?
-What?</b>

10:12.770 --> 10:15.030
<b>This stuff don't come cheap, you know.</b>

10:15.110 --> 10:16.780
<b>-So expensive!
-So expensive!</b>

10:16.860 --> 10:18.610
<b>I don't have any cash on me.</b>

10:19.910 --> 10:23.080
<b>Fine, fine! If that's how it's gotta be,
I'll pay with my body!</b>

10:23.160 --> 10:27.330
<b>I'll give you a taste of Heaven
with my divine diddling technique.</b>

10:29.500 --> 10:32.380
<b>Don't touch my vagina
with your dirty whore fingers, bitch!</b>

10:33.460 --> 10:34.800
<b>Is this what I think it is?</b>

10:34.880 --> 10:37.970
<b>The Legendary Heavenly
Backlace Weapon with Central Ribbon!</b>

10:38.050 --> 10:40.760
<b>-This is way better than your finger!
-What the hell?</b>

10:40.840 --> 10:43.310
<b>Gun, gun, gun…</b>

10:43.390 --> 10:44.970
<b>Damn this stupid lock!</b>

10:45.060 --> 10:49.230
<b>Gun, gun, gun…</b>

10:49.310 --> 10:51.020
<b>Guns!</b>

10:51.100 --> 10:52.480
<b>Neigh!</b>

10:53.230 --> 10:56.320
<b>Here you are. The lock is all gone,
plus everything else you asked for.</b>

10:56.400 --> 10:59.200
<b>I also wrote down your target location
and threw in a toy as a bonus.</b>

10:59.280 --> 11:01.870
<b>That was nice of her
to let us do a Buy Now, Pay Later.</b>

11:01.950 --> 11:04.200
<b>But how does she know
where we're meant to be going?</b>

11:04.280 --> 11:06.290
<b>Hello? I'm omniscient, baby!</b>

11:06.370 --> 11:08.370
<b>Hell yeah!
Just you wait, you plastic fantastics.</b>

11:08.460 --> 11:10.170
<b>Let's see where they're at.</b>

11:10.250 --> 11:11.290
<b>The hospital?</b>

11:24.100 --> 11:25.970
<b>-You're giving me stitches!
-Laughing fit here!</b>

11:26.060 --> 11:28.100
<b>-Shut up!
-You wouldn't catch me dead doing that.</b>

11:28.180 --> 11:31.310
<b>Such are the duties
of a traditional angel.</b>

11:31.400 --> 11:34.980
<b>Not all traditions are bad.
You might try upholding some yourselves.</b>

11:35.070 --> 11:39.440
<b>Are you kidding? You'd never catch me
flying around naked with some trumpet.</b>

11:39.530 --> 11:41.110
<b>Not in a million years!</b>

11:41.200 --> 11:42.240
<b>Look, I got you.</b>

11:42.780 --> 11:43.910
<b>Caught in 4K, dude!</b>

11:43.990 --> 11:46.160
<b>This is totally gonna go
viral once it hits the net!</b>

11:46.240 --> 11:47.330
<b>Shut up, boomer.</b>

11:47.410 --> 11:49.500
<b>Stupid illiterate half-wits!</b>

11:53.790 --> 11:54.790
<b>What's going on?</b>

11:54.880 --> 11:57.590
<b>-An Anti-gravity Mounter?
-Where'd you get that?</b>

11:57.670 --> 12:00.920
<b>Nobody knows this dump of a town
more than us.</b>

12:01.800 --> 12:04.010
<b>You do know that's, like,
an illegal attachment, right?</b>

12:04.090 --> 12:07.220
<b>Like, we'll low-key be reporting this
to the higher-ups.</b>

12:07.310 --> 12:11.060
<b>I'm in the mood for a little betting.
Whoever takes out more Ghosts, wins.</b>

12:11.140 --> 12:15.020
<b>The winner gets the right
to keep hunting Ghosts around here.</b>

12:15.110 --> 12:17.400
<b>Or do you need to run it past Daddy first?</b>

12:17.480 --> 12:20.280
<b>Maybe the babies can't
make decisions for themselves?</b>

12:20.360 --> 12:23.320
<b>A bet? Bet. We'll mop the floor with you.</b>

12:23.410 --> 12:27.870
<b>I, like, can't wait to teach these two
mid angel bitches a lesson or three.</b>

12:29.120 --> 12:30.120
<b>-Suckers.
-Suckers.</b>

12:30.950 --> 12:32.210
<b>The finish line is the church.</b>

12:32.290 --> 12:36.000
<b>Whoever defeats the most Ghosts
and gets to the goal first, wins.</b>

12:42.550 --> 12:43.680
<b>Okay, baby.</b>

12:43.760 --> 12:46.390
<b>-Ready, set…
-Neigh!</b>

12:46.470 --> 12:47.800
<b>…go!</b>

12:52.890 --> 12:55.270
<b>Chuck, chuck, chuck…</b>

12:55.350 --> 12:56.810
<b>Yo, where all the Ghosts at?</b>

12:56.900 --> 12:58.190
<b>Did they all just vanish?</b>

12:58.270 --> 12:59.270
<b>Chuck…</b>

13:00.480 --> 13:03.360
<b>Like, this will be a total breeze, no cap!</b>

13:06.660 --> 13:08.490
<b>-See ya, sweeties!
-See ya, sweeties!</b>

13:08.580 --> 13:10.240
<b>Hey, no fair!</b>

13:10.330 --> 13:12.620
<b>Goddamn it. Isn't there anything useful?</b>

13:12.700 --> 13:14.290
<b>Maybe our new toy?</b>

13:14.370 --> 13:15.500
<b>Yeah, use that!</b>

13:15.580 --> 13:17.670
<b>Time for our own little comeback.</b>

13:17.750 --> 13:19.920
<b>Huh? They're all over the town.</b>

13:20.000 --> 13:21.420
<b>No way! The town's really
fallen apart this badly?!</b>

13:21.510 --> 13:22.510
<b>This is…</b>

13:23.380 --> 13:25.180
<b>gonna be a big haul!</b>

13:26.090 --> 13:28.050
<b>-Buh-bye, babies.
-Buh-bye, babies.</b>

13:28.140 --> 13:30.260
<b>Do you hear a Karen, or is it just me?</b>

13:30.350 --> 13:33.730
<b>Again with the illegal gear.
Their cheating is off the charts.</b>

13:33.810 --> 13:35.690
<b>Shift's almost over… time to bounce.</b>

13:42.190 --> 13:43.690
<b>Wanna know what I think?</b>

13:43.780 --> 13:47.320
<b>Lowkey feels like we're about
to kick it into high gear!</b>

13:49.160 --> 13:51.990
<b>O evil spirit…</b>

13:52.790 --> 13:55.500
<b>born of those lost
between Heaven and Earth.</b>

14:02.500 --> 14:04.630
<b>May the thunderous power
from the garments…</b>

14:07.720 --> 14:10.140
<b>of these holy, tender-skinned youths…</b>

14:12.260 --> 14:13.850
<b>cleanse your filth and foulness,</b>

14:14.890 --> 14:16.100
<b>corruption and blight…</b>

14:17.350 --> 14:19.150
<b>be shattered into dust</b>

14:19.730 --> 14:21.730
<b>and return you to Heaven and Earth!</b>

14:27.490 --> 14:28.820
<b>Repent!</b>

14:32.200 --> 14:34.160
<b>I think they just overtook us.</b>

14:34.240 --> 14:36.660
<b>Jesus Christ!
We're gonna lose at this rate!</b>

14:36.750 --> 14:37.870
<b>Neigh!</b>

14:37.960 --> 14:41.840
<b>You there! We ain't got time
for nomming our way to Candy Mountain.</b>

14:42.460 --> 14:43.630
<b>Wait.</b>

14:43.710 --> 14:46.420
<b>The Demon Fusion and Split Switch!
Forgot we bought this too.</b>

14:51.010 --> 14:53.560
<b>Huh? Why does my mouth taste like grass?</b>

14:53.640 --> 14:55.060
<b>We'll get to that later!</b>

14:55.140 --> 14:57.020
<b>No time to lose. You gotta help us!</b>

14:57.850 --> 15:00.480
<b>What's this?
You want the demons to help you?</b>

15:00.560 --> 15:03.360
<b>Oh, how the mighty have fallen.</b>

15:03.440 --> 15:06.940
<b>If you know, you know, right?
And I know losers when I see 'em.</b>

15:07.030 --> 15:10.110
<b>The victory is totally palpable.</b>

15:10.200 --> 15:14.080
<b>I almost feel bad for them.
But it could also just be gas.</b>

15:14.780 --> 15:15.790
<b>What was that?</b>

15:17.120 --> 15:18.710
<b>Demons?</b>

15:21.330 --> 15:23.210
<b>Go choke on your own bulges, shitheads!</b>

15:23.290 --> 15:24.880
<b>What's this?</b>

15:24.960 --> 15:26.500
<b>Attacking on both sides?</b>

15:26.590 --> 15:28.340
<b>-How hilarious!
-How hilarious!</b>

15:32.930 --> 15:34.260
<b>They split into two.</b>

15:35.180 --> 15:36.310
<b>It's a transformer!</b>

15:37.060 --> 15:39.390
<b>-You cheating little rats!
-You cheating little rats!</b>

16:05.840 --> 16:10.550
<b>Angels teaming up with demons?
It's a violation of Heavenly law.</b>

16:10.630 --> 16:13.050
<b>Heaven's rules?
I couldn't care less!</b>

16:13.130 --> 16:17.310
<b>Mmm yeah, see… I'm a proud bitch,
so rules and strings? Not my thing.</b>

16:17.390 --> 16:19.310
<b>Dinner's ready, dear.</b>

17:15.030 --> 17:16.820
<b>They're coming! What is that?</b>

17:17.950 --> 17:19.240
<b>That…</b>

17:19.330 --> 17:21.750
<b>is what happens when you kill
too many Ghosts too quickly.</b>

17:21.830 --> 17:24.710
<b>It's an amalgamation
of Ghost on Ghost on Ghost.</b>

17:24.790 --> 17:27.960
<b>It's one Giant Ghost resonating
to the fear of many Ghosts!</b>

17:28.040 --> 17:29.290
<b>Holy crap!</b>

17:30.380 --> 17:31.840
<b>This has gotten way out of hand.</b>

17:31.920 --> 17:34.050
<b>But we're pretty much equal
in terms of coins.</b>

17:34.130 --> 17:35.680
<b>So, according to rules,</b>

17:35.760 --> 17:38.430
<b>whoever kills that one first, wins!</b>

17:38.510 --> 17:39.510
<b>Exactly!</b>

17:40.100 --> 17:43.810
<b>Bruh, the thought of being as mid as them,
like, totally gives me the ick!</b>

17:43.890 --> 17:45.980
<b>Absolutely not. Hard pass!</b>

17:46.060 --> 17:48.650
<b>-Ick!
-Ick!</b>

17:57.410 --> 17:59.660
<b>-That's it.
-Yep, we're done here.</b>

18:02.990 --> 18:04.370
<b>Oh, hell nah.</b>

18:04.450 --> 18:08.170
<b>They're adding everything
in the Heaven's Online Store to cart.</b>

18:08.250 --> 18:09.540
<b>What is that?</b>

18:09.630 --> 18:13.050
<b>That's the Double Triple Sextuple
Heavenly Cannon.</b>

18:13.130 --> 18:15.760
<b>We're fuckin' done for
if they shoot somethin' that big!</b>

18:16.670 --> 18:20.090
<b>Let's buy some things ourselves
on the Hell's Online Store!</b>

18:20.180 --> 18:21.550
<b>No battery?</b>

18:21.640 --> 18:25.180
<b>No good… No good either…
That's all there is!</b>

18:25.270 --> 18:26.560
<b>-Need a hand?
-You?</b>

18:26.640 --> 18:28.350
<b>Still got a consumer itch to scratch?</b>

18:28.440 --> 18:31.650
<b>Get in now while everything's
only three times the price!</b>

18:31.730 --> 18:33.650
<b>Fine! Gimme all you got!</b>

18:33.730 --> 18:34.980
<b>Thanks, bestie!</b>

18:35.070 --> 18:36.820
<b>It's illegal, circumvent,
and totes demonic!</b>

18:36.900 --> 18:38.150
<b>Hell yeah!</b>

18:38.240 --> 18:40.370
<b>And it comes with a new
costume for her pleasure!</b>

18:41.490 --> 18:46.830
<b>We, the Holy Twins, Angels of Heaven,
descended to cleanse the Earth.</b>

18:50.080 --> 18:55.510
<b>We, the Unholy Twins, Demons of Darkness,
emerged to scourge the Earth.</b>

19:03.180 --> 19:05.890
<b>O evil spirits,
caught between light and darkness,</b>

19:07.640 --> 19:10.020
<b>adrift and aimless upon the Earth.</b>

19:12.110 --> 19:14.900
<b>We shed our dues, our debts, our dignity,</b>

19:16.070 --> 19:18.650
<b>to wield anew the thunderous lightning.</b>

19:21.280 --> 19:24.160
<b>With it, we shall rend and tear,
torment and smite.</b>

19:25.580 --> 19:28.000
<b>We shall burn, impale, and
grind thee beneath our heel.</b>

19:30.370 --> 19:33.080
<b>It shall be cast to the farthest bounds,</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:37.300
<b>beyond the cradle from whence it came.</b>

19:39.920 --> 19:41.430
<b>Repent!</b>

19:43.970 --> 19:45.850
<b>Return to the dark!</b>

19:49.600 --> 19:50.850
<b>What the helly?</b>

19:55.980 --> 19:57.780
<b>I mean…</b>

19:57.860 --> 19:59.240
<b>Like…</b>

19:59.320 --> 20:01.240
<b>-We're so cooked!
-We're so cooked!</b>

20:06.370 --> 20:07.950
<b>-For real?
-I can't even…</b>

20:18.630 --> 20:21.510
<b>Jackpot!</b>

20:24.840 --> 20:26.720
<b>They did it!</b>

20:30.770 --> 20:33.100
<b>Bruh… This cannot be happening right now.</b>

20:33.190 --> 20:36.480
<b>I mean… Like…</b>

20:36.560 --> 20:38.360
<b>We just took the fattest L!</b>

20:38.440 --> 20:39.980
<b><i>You two!</i></b>

20:40.070 --> 20:43.280
<b><i>What in the Heavens are you doing?</i></b>

20:47.080 --> 20:48.160
<b>Your Highness!</b>

20:48.240 --> 20:49.410
<b>Uncle Ramie?</b>

20:49.490 --> 20:53.670
<b>Panty, Stocking, please excuse my boys.</b>

20:53.750 --> 20:56.250
<b>I do apologize
for their raising havoc on Earth</b>

20:56.330 --> 20:58.040
<b>and getting in the way of your work.</b>

20:58.130 --> 21:00.300
<b>-Nah, we're cool. How's it going?
-This was their doing!</b>

21:00.380 --> 21:04.340
<b>Now you listen here. Panty and Stocking
are the daughters of the King.</b>

21:04.430 --> 21:06.890
<b>And you, oh adjunctive ones,
are merely the King's nephews.</b>

21:06.970 --> 21:08.930
<b>There are limits to your station!</b>

21:09.010 --> 21:12.850
<b>And what's this?
Wasting money on more expensive gadgets?</b>

21:14.980 --> 21:19.520
<b>Panty, Stocking, I will take care
of things in Heaven's court</b>

21:19.610 --> 21:22.070
<b>and make sure
your Heaven Licenses are reinstated.</b>

21:22.150 --> 21:25.110
<b>Could you find it in your hearts
to forgive my sons this one time?</b>

21:25.200 --> 21:26.240
<b>Yeah, we can do that.</b>

21:26.320 --> 21:28.120
<b>Let bygones be bygones!
My name is Garter－</b>

21:28.200 --> 21:32.450
<b>Then, until we meet again!
Behave well, Panty and Stocking!</b>

21:32.540 --> 21:33.580
<b>See ya!</b>

21:33.660 --> 21:34.870
<b>Bye-bye, Uncle Ramie!</b>

21:34.960 --> 21:36.420
<b>That was truly the hand of God.</b>

21:36.500 --> 21:37.540
<b>God Hand!</b>

21:38.170 --> 21:40.130
<b>Looks like it all worked out in the end.</b>

21:40.210 --> 21:43.260
<b>Yep. I think tonight we take this cash
and go crazy broadway style!</b>

21:45.050 --> 21:48.010
<b>Yoo-hoo! Later has come
for your Buy Now, Pay Later.</b>

21:49.140 --> 21:52.770
<b>And here's your receipt.
Ya'll drop by again sometime, okay?</b>

21:54.390 --> 21:57.730
<b>Fuck! Get back here!
Damn that thieving Gunsmith Bitch!</b>

21:57.810 --> 22:01.570
<b>Hey, Toilet Sisters,
don't forget that we did you a favor too.</b>

22:02.190 --> 22:04.860
<b>A pact with a demon never comes cheap.</b>

22:04.940 --> 22:05.990
<b>Another day of peace.</b>

22:06.650 --> 22:08.280
<b>The nerve of you two!</b>

22:08.360 --> 22:10.660
<b>Don't forget we found you
whinnying and munching weeds.</b>

22:10.740 --> 22:12.950
<b>Shoulda left the nags as a nag.</b>

23:51.970 --> 23:54.970
<b>Please forgive us, your Highness.</b>

23:55.640 --> 23:58.140
<b>On the contrary.
You have done well, my children.</b>

23:58.220 --> 23:59.930
<b>Everything went just as expected.</b>

24:00.020 --> 24:03.940
<b>And as for your little operation
against Panty and Stocking…</b>

24:05.520 --> 24:07.690
<b>-Please continue.
-As you wish!</b>

24:07.780 --> 24:09.740
<b>Subtitle: Daisy Savage & Rychelle Brittain</b>
